    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_1">
        <text>And the day will come, and the Monolith will shine again in its glory.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_10">
        <text>The Monolith is light and knowledge, knowledge and light. It will return. It will return.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_11">
        <text>The time will come, the chosen ones will be saved. The Monolith will grant them perfection.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_12">
        <text>Trust no one except the Monolith and your brothers. No one.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_13">
        <text>The enemies are close. Such is the will of the Monolith.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_14">
        <text>We know what they want, but we will fulfill our purpose, we will protect the Monolith, it will return and rejoice, it will rejoice - we will rejoice.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_15">
        <text>They thought to catch us off guard, but the great Monolith gave us strength, opened our eyes.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_16">
        <text>Monolith, why have you forsaken us? We weep. We wait.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_17">
        <text>Monolith, your children await you. Your wisdom, your strength, your light.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_18">
        <text>We are strong by your will, Monolith. You guided us. You gave us sight and knowledge. Why do we not hear your voice?</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_19">
        <text>Monolith.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_2">
        <text>What am I... here... No, Monolith. Great Monolith. Where are you?</text>
    </string>
