    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_3">
        <text>The Monolith. It has left us.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_4">
        <text>Yesterday water from the sky. Wet. Cold. I am cold...</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_5">
        <text>But then the first one came from the Monolith and said: be enlightened. But they did not listen.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_6">
        <text>Monolith, Monolith, return to your abandoned children.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_7">
        <text>And on that day, when the worthy one is recognized, the Monolith will return.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_8">
        <text>I need... I need to remember... Monolith, help me.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_idle_idle_9">
        <text>Do not leave me, Monolith. Do not leave us, your children.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_loot_loot_bad_1">
        <text>There is nothing here for the servants of the Monolith.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_loot_loot_bad_2">
