    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_loot_loot_begin_1">
        <text>Equipment for the living servants of the Monolith.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_loot_loot_begin_2">
        <text>The departed have no need; the remaining will take.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_loot_loot_begin_3">
        <text>Not every thing is useful, said the Monolith.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_loot_loot_good_1">
        <text>All for the good of the Monolith.</text>
    </string>
    <string id="characters_voice_human_01_monolith_states_loot_loot_good_2">
